  "about": {
    "kicker": "About me",
    "name": "Nazanin Panahi",
    "role": "AI Consultant · Founder of SYNIQ",
    "body": "I'm an AI consultant with a background in construction project management and five years of experience working on complex construction projects. That experience gave me firsthand insight into the challenges businesses face every day, managing client relationships, responding quickly to enquiries, staying organised, and keeping up with rapidly changing technology.\n\nI founded my AI consultancy to help business owners, freelancers, and startups use practical AI solutions to save time, improve customer experience, and operate more efficiently. From AI-powered customer support and content creation to workflow automation and branding, I help businesses look more professional while working smarter and more affordably.\n\nMy approach combines real-world business understanding with modern AI tools, ensuring that technology solves genuine business problems rather than adding complexity.",
    "valuesTitle": "What I stand for, SYNIQ",
    "values": [
      {
        "title": "Strategy-led (S)",
        "desc": "Every proposal starts with a clear map, not guesswork and trial-and-error."
